# 🛒 Cartify — MERN Stack E-Commerce Platform

Cartify is a full-stack e-commerce web application built using the **MERN Stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js)**.

The application provides a complete online shopping experience where users can browse products, view product details, add products to their cart, manage quantities, place orders, make payments, write reviews, and manage their accounts.

The project also includes backend APIs, authentication, product management, order management, and payment integration.

