---

### 🔐 Authentication & Security

* JWT authentication
* Protected routes
* Password-based authentication
* Role-based access control
* Secure API endpoints
* Environment variables for sensitive configuration
* CORS configuration

---

### 💳 Payment Integration

Cartify supports online payments using **Razorpay**.

The payment system allows users to:

* Start checkout
* Create payment orders
* Complete online payments
* Verify payment status
* Update order information after successful payment

> Payment credentials should always be stored in environment variables and should never be committed to GitHub.

