# 🌐 Deployment

Cartify can be deployed using separate services for the frontend and backend.

A recommended production architecture is:

```text
                    GitHub
                      │
          ┌───────────┴───────────┐
          │                       │
          ▼                       ▼
      Frontend                 Backend
      Vercel/Netlify          Render/Railway
          │                       │
          └───────────┬───────────┘
                      │
                      ▼
                MongoDB Atlas
                      │
                      ▼
                  Razorpay
```

### Frontend

The React/Vite frontend can be deployed on:

* Vercel
* Netlify

### Backend

The Node.js/Express backend can be deployed on:

* Render
* Railway

### Database

MongoDB Atlas can be used for the production database.

---

# 📦 Production Build

To create a production build for the frontend:

```bash
cd Frontend
npm run build
```

The production files will generally be generated inside:

```text
dist/
```

